                <l xml:id="m-a98023ec-d286-4ba0-abf1-66e97896e817" facs="#m-724189c0-12c7-4a01-932e-c28d60c55ee9" label="text-like">15th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-7699d1b7-ce3d-40a4-98b9-39074fa0aba9" facs="#m-6f220ee8-f71c-42f0-b0f0-6faa3e26e7d5" label="ambiguous">1041</l><l xml:id="m-9d9ef644-7794-4d09-ace4-710b2beda1c4" facs="#m-e65e1585-62d1-4a59-ac00-c22be28c4930" label="lyrics-like">dí¬ </l><l xml:id="m-b7c8ff59-a96d-44cf-8d04-551fd0377ec4" facs="#m-7c5c4e2c-3f86-4af1-b84b-db0b4cff1868" label="lyrics-like">ne, quóni¬</l><l xml:id="m-6eb58d14-9fca-429b-93ad-b5f666225cd5" facs="#m-6468674a-1a81-4b1c-89fc-75dae2313f19" label="lyrics-like">am ad te clamá¬ vi tó¬ ta</l><l xml:id="m-aa1d5f54-77cd-46d1-8397-89e2319146b6" facs="#m-87da4bc2-6996-49f0-9d9b-300a944d92e7" label="lyrics-like">Ps. Laetí-fi-ca ánimam sérvi tú¬i:* quó-ni-am ad te, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-cf643de5-37c8-44ad-82d2-3146cb036c63" facs="#m-404ea8f6-d34e-4e7a-9fc8-a0ad902f6a58" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-1e7ed030-20bb-48f5-85ae-dbd817b3b633" facs="#m-53feed75-02a4-4c47-b06f-f52ea54a8131" label="lyrics-like">mine, ánimam mé¬ am levá¬ vi.</l><l xml:id="m-9c77045d-e10b-4240-9219-dcc33924074b" facs="#m-c66f9123-db91-4626-9191-bc74b7e033f8" label="ambiguous">E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-980c0559-baf9-472a-9d96-fab7dc922d88" facs="#m-0ab84a31-6e82-4426-99cb-d821a693e7be" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-ba16bd40-045f-42f4-9c4a-6209da0103d6" facs="#m-90027fbc-9bf4-475b-9c4c-24c517d41fa1" label="lyrics-like">(yCclésiam tuam Dómine miserá-] salva consistere, “ tuo semper mú¬</l><l xml:id="m-d6894079-c7e8-498c-8bf6-f57b32fcc716" facs="#m-d1e12013-1ebf-4b3d-a3aa-7c6a4402e98a" label="lyrics-like">C tio continuáta mundet et mú- nere gubernétur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-282726e1-fcf2-4bac-a49d-ebd2a39a8c8a" facs="#m-4801edfd-058e-448d-890e-aeee8a04a5c0" label="ambiguous">niat: t et quia sine te non potest</l><l xml:id="m-184f988a-e83f-46fe-a923-dffbfb0e056f" facs="#m-9dc6a6ac-d19c-4564-8621-3541ffd0b534" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-b9a49c29-d5f2-4a74-8783-663cac09bf4f" facs="#m-14af900e-7820-4a77-a3df-68151ca5d448" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Galatas. Gal. 5. d. 6.</l><l xml:id="m-f9cd5804-fb85-4d64-9eaf-65d1676d10fb" facs="#m-4a96e99e-1ec7-45b5-8934-abca9a586570" label="lyrics-like">LTRatres: Si spíritu vivimus, spi-[onus suum portábit. Commúnicet</l><l xml:id="m-609010f3-0c43-4f36-9216-a097ef415cbc" facs="#m-85f2695e-ceb5-4bad-afa4-84a1b86e05f9" label="lyrics-like">T ritu et ambulémus. Non effi-lautem is, qui catechizátur verbo, ei</l><l xml:id="m-db592a96-b1c6-4870-9069-df656eaed0a7" facs="#m-8e7d5144-1ea5-46c4-ba4e-bd6a5405e3e0" label="lyrics-like">ciámur inánis glóriae cúpidi, invi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5bdd038a-6238-4805-898b-e0fa2ef3a4d9" facs="#m-55255cd0-c12d-4f80-8968-6ca73040f3fe" label="lyrics-like">qui se catechizat, in ómnibus bonis.</l><l xml:id="m-4326a317-dd9a-46cf-8643-85dcecadafee" facs="#m-715d6015-48b0-4176-8b57-ea8fcbbcafd0" label="lyrics-like">Nolite erráre: Deus non irridétur.</l><l xml:id="m-e4de08d6-fcb8-41df-b0a7-6cd61f90574e" facs="#m-c4f39cc7-b400-4014-8939-f9655545e084" label="lyrics-like">cem provocántes, invicem invidén¬</l><l xml:id="m-06c262a4-3f87-46fe-83bc-d05ed4d3adeb" facs="#m-6b67d0bd-2029-488d-b14e-1fadc201eaeb" label="lyrics-like">Quae enim semináverit homo, haec</l><l xml:id="m-47f27d97-856e-41dc-8b78-c7d860ee358c" facs="#m-f72064c3-b3fb-482b-9a89-518cf51be163" label="lyrics-like">tes. Fratres, et si praeoccupátus</l><l xml:id="m-d6b8c5b8-39d6-446d-bb34-a1eafcd5a65d" facs="#m-9a45e2ec-25b1-47bc-9794-a88f18afc34a" label="lyrics-like">et metet. Quóniam qui séminat in</l><l xml:id="m-b8a8173b-b189-4813-9781-35cf0ffa9253" facs="#m-dfc901aa-0e52-4c92-85f1-dc8a28797b30" label="lyrics-like">fúerit homo in áliquo delícto, vos,</l><l xml:id="m-93a5044f-e740-4317-8f9b-3986187ae6dc" facs="#m-92d8bb0c-bc98-46c7-b36c-7e0cb8a9eb6c" label="lyrics-like">qui spirituáles estis, hujúsmodi in¬</l><l xml:id="m-09d7eabf-9f2b-4ae6-b003-01a4ff0297c9" facs="#m-db5aadd6-3076-45e8-8918-250e2a7357b2" label="ambiguous">carne sua, de carne et metet corru¬</l><l xml:id="m-1fd5ce50-5527-45bc-925c-cff5e2831032" facs="#m-d0e3738b-444c-48fd-9b99-e54376e06f0e" label="lyrics-like">ptiónem: qui autem séminat in spí¬</l><l xml:id="m-5841ceec-e7d6-4f12-9f62-2d2fa5e3cf47" facs="#m-52fc9804-6135-41ee-b1e6-fc233e7ef79f" label="lyrics-like">struite in spíritu lenitátis, consí¬</l><l xml:id="m-dc7e2c79-26d7-4f9b-8d6e-08514ae7d4ae" facs="#m-5ac2e440-0155-4222-96a7-eded00d948b5" label="lyrics-like">ritu, de spíritu metet vitam aetér¬</l><l xml:id="m-93d61f43-0bcf-444b-84e3-e75ecf0c45a4" facs="#m-e2049c27-bbb1-42aa-9b7d-f97704eb507b" label="lyrics-like">derans teípsum, ne et tu tentéris.</l><l xml:id="m-c00a090b-93c0-4103-9deb-d46be55119e7" facs="#m-960184df-1810-43c9-af69-79e7baf904b2" label="lyrics-like">nam. Bonum autem faciéntes, non</l><l xml:id="m-88633724-2f71-42c9-a70e-e8841c4530f2" facs="#m-c85fb406-743a-4afe-ab31-2af58c68ef3c" label="lyrics-like">Alter altérius ónera portáte, et sic</l><l xml:id="m-c1ff2c7d-ed3d-47a7-a0c2-c021f2eeb004" facs="#m-3236abf5-13b4-45b4-9af9-1712bb65bc51" label="lyrics-like">adimplébitis legem Christi. Nam si</l><l xml:id="m-7f60db08-9dee-41b9-b03c-a59a83bdd9d2" facs="#m-3e914540-c1bd-4315-a916-39e36860ad02" label="lyrics-like">deficiámus: témpore enim suo me¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ec5e7d8-d80e-4c2a-b2d9-ce5e9f035cb9" facs="#m-9eeedee2-74ea-4a87-91b8-ad126af24ea8" label="lyrics-like">témus, non deficiéntes. Ergo dum</l><l xml:id="m-520b4aa4-f655-4166-8f9f-934e867aeb1a" facs="#m-e51cdbea-035a-40ed-9bc6-dd1fa2c88acc" label="lyrics-like">quis exístimat se áliquid esse, cum</l><l xml:id="m-fb5065cd-5f7b-42e2-8c82-f1f880c60533" facs="#m-bbcadc4c-66d5-4077-8431-118a4986f41c" label="lyrics-like">tempus habémus, operémur bonum</l><l xml:id="m-32e20521-1177-417d-8c5a-50f8394a9ec4" facs="#m-86c2b5fa-58aa-4261-8eb3-c5601ca8f71c" label="lyrics-like">nihil sit, ipse se sedúcit. Opus autem</l><l xml:id="m-780a0fb8-a3ce-49c9-a393-2b5e3a530a6a" facs="#m-667343dc-a6f0-4901-82e0-ecc2da22159d" label="lyrics-like">ad omnes, máxime autem ad do¬</l><l xml:id="m-4763675d-59a2-4538-a43b-e69bca595b70" facs="#m-096119a1-7473-42f3-99e6-815f39b17be2" label="lyrics-like">suum probet unusquísque, et sic in</l><l xml:id="m-e239ad63-82a4-4a8d-aba6-f8603896778b" facs="#m-bd918182-7a77-45ad-a987-5499bef6405a" label="lyrics-like">semetipso tantum glóriam habébit, mésticos fidei.</l><l xml:id="m-5e9abc6f-9b3e-4602-85df-de03ddab2e31" facs="#m-6c8c3536-b3b7-401d-8ee9-493c25064e35" label="lyrics-like">et non in áltero. Unusquísque enim</l><l xml:id="m-594d05f5-784e-4664-96c5-9ef0a9f3886a" facs="#m-1d00739d-e124-429d-8541-27c9287e5a7e" label="ambiguous">Grad.E</l><l xml:id="m-c835836d-afa0-428e-a62d-06e33ce6ecea" facs="#m-a9a4fe35-c1ae-4765-8149-32aa282c80ff" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-38c114aa-c4ef-4fe6-8451-eb3f62667e40" facs="#m-4c7e49b7-3862-48f8-a976-5feaafe18f53" label="ambiguous">Bomum est</l><l xml:id="m-39fba875-88a5-4a28-8a93-81c9ec343a44" facs="#m-97b50a09-471d-46b6-9f01-48be1924924f" label="lyrics-like">confi-té¬ ri Dómi-no:</l><l xml:id="m-380a0197-681c-4b5a-9f3d-e323049b1198" facs="#m-4ce90f9d-6a48-4d0b-925d-53fc837a4ca6" label="lyrics-like">o, Altís¬</l><l xml:id="m-80200151-fbbf-4eb1-a703-e8ed08f1b356" facs="#m-6166ba9c-c017-4195-9520-6435afa12e18" label="lyrics-like">et psálle-re nó- mini tú¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
